@startuml F4.1b-self-assign
title F4.1b — Self-assign no pool CAAF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CAAFController" as Ctrl
participant "AssignFormativeUC" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Atribuir a mim
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /comissoes/caaf/atribuicoes
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE assignee\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
note right of UC
  self ≠ push externo;
  item → /formativas?to=me
end note
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: badge "Comigo"

@enduml
